<div class="childlisting " id="_26f422153b9e455f8cd834034de5242a">
    <div class="content-wrap">
        <h2></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="childlisting-list ">
        <div class="content-wrap">
                <a class="childlisting-list-item" href="/company-profile/careers/we-currently-have-no-new-vacancies/">
                    <div class="childlisting-list-item-inner">
                        <p class="tag blue-light">Careers</p>
                        <h4>We currently have no new vacancies</h4>
                        <p class="view"><span></span> View More</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="content-wrap mb-5 box-bg" id="_c998a7c2979a4ed48ba25036e455c77e" style="">
    <div class="rte narrow">
        <h2>Our Values</h2>
<p>Our values support our vision and mission and define our common beliefs. They were chosen by our employees as the behaviours which we all strive to act by - both as an organisation and individually.</p>
<h3>Be responsible</h3>
<p><strong style="font-size: 16px;">For yourself, for your team, for the planet<br /></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>We take responsibility for our own actions and are accountable for them</li>
<li>We build our future success by working together to help achieve individual, team and business objectives</li>
<li>We conduct and manage our business in a responsible and sustainable way</li>
</ul>
<h3>Be curious</h3>
<p><strong style="font-size: 16px;">Ask, learn and innovate for good<br /></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>We ask questions – an inquisitive and investigative mindset underpins effective regulation</li>
<li>We adapt our approach to enhance our competitiveness – finding new (and often better) ways of doing things</li>
<li>We operate within a dynamic international environment and seek out new opportunities as they emerge</li>
</ul>
<h3>Be connected<span class="green"><br /></span></h3>
<p><strong style="font-size: 16px;">Together we are more<br /></strong></p>
<ul>
<li>We work together to provide our market with the highest levels of service</li>
<li>We are responsive - engaging with our stakeholders (including market participants, regulators and industry associations) to adapt and improve our products and services</li>
<li>We support and engage with the communities in which we live and work</li>
</ul>
    </div>
</div><div class="content-wrap  box-bg" id="_5e9937e24153476aafa4201e46592039" style="">
    <div class="rte narrow">
        <h2 style="text-align: left;">Our Commitment to You</h2>
<p><strong>Your Development</strong></p>
<h3>Our success is founded in the quality of our staff. At TISE we have a true passion for providing the right support for our staff so that they can achieve their full potential.</h3>
<p>We have implemented an internal Career Development Framework, so that staff members can see what their future career will look like, and how to achieve their career aspirations. We also look to support our staff in undertaking relevant courses and qualifications, below are some of the industry bodies that we have supported our staff in achieving qualifications through.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="content-wrap mt-4 mb-2 box-bg" id="_022dae2a423d4fe093bc3987fb4304f1" style="">
    <div class="rte wide">
        <p><img src="/media/ijmai0sj/77b38e75bc0e5dd30ed4afce497a857f.png?width=109&amp;height=109" alt="" width="109" height="109">     <img src="/media/kqupav5q/1426c8bd474c28f77ce3346d586a51a9.png?width=109&amp;height=109" alt="" width="109" height="109">     <img src="/media/13ppsrfe/4493edadf45eddc3b5e4f700bef90b39.png?width=109&amp;height=109" alt="" width="109" height="109">     <img src="/media/0svbrhsy/066183705792187bea8f4982331646b7.png?width=108&amp;height=109" alt="" width="108" height="109">     <img src="/media/bqqi01yn/dd2f37509924c49b242e2ad7ebcbe729.png?width=109&amp;height=109" alt="" width="109" height="109">     <img src="/media/k2rixhwe/e4b6a51ebc7b7a3788b1d332316d07eb.png?width=108&amp;height=109" alt="" width="108" height="109">   <img src="/media/thiotxdw/icma.png?width=108&amp;height=109" alt="" width="108" height="109">     <img src="/media/ojil5cgb/bath-uni.png?width=108&amp;height=109" alt="" width="108" height="109">     <img src="/media/05vbsruc/manchester-business-school.png?width=108&amp;height=109" alt="" width="108" height="109"></p>
<p> </p>
    </div>
</div><div class="content-wrap mt-0 box-bg" id="_43995ca56ad84bf38805f0cda810b84e" style="">
    <div class="rte wide">
        <p><strong>Your Wellbeing<span class="Apple-converted-space"> <br /></span></strong>We have looked to implement a number of initiatives that support our staff wellbeing. Each year as an organisation we look to recognise Mental Health Awareness Week as well as organising our own Wellbeing Week each year. We also offer our staff an annual subsidy towards supporting their wellbeing whether that be towards a gym membership, yoga classes etc, private health insurance, dental insurance and free eye tests as part of their employment with TISE.<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span></p>
<p>We also have a number of staff members who are trained Mental Health First Aiders and Safer Spaces Champions, so that we can aim to identify, understand, support and help any staff member who may be experiencing a mental health issue or domestic abuse.</p>
<p><strong>Your Choice</strong><span class="Apple-converted-space"> <br /></span>Here at TISE we have also implemented initiatives such as ‘Dress for your Day’ and remote working in order to give staff flexibility in their employment.</p>
    </div>
</div>
    </div>
</div><div class="textslider mb-6" id="_1c2ebe0c99f6420d99b84db7c5c3b497">
    <div class="content-wrap">
        <img src="/media/qsdny0ls/use-male-male-fem.png" />
        <p class="tag">Life at TISE</p>
        <div class="textslider-slides">
                <div class="textslider-slides-item">
                    <h2>Emily Humphry, Chief Governance Officer</h2>
                    <div class="cols c1">
                            <h3>&quot;When I joined TISE in 2017, I knew that I wanted to undertake further professional study to achieve my qualification as a Chartered Secretary. TISE provided a supportive and flexible working environment to enable me to attend study days and prepare for exams and coursework submissions. In 2020, after three years&#x2019; study, I graduated with a Master&#x2019;s degree in Corporate Governance from Bournemouth University and attained Chartered status with the Chartered Governance Institute UK and Ireland.&quot;</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="textslider-slides-item">
                    <h2>Adrian D'Arcy, Manager - Market Regulation</h2>
                    <div class="cols c1">
                            <h3>&#x201C;Since joining TISE I have been able to progress and expand my skills significantly in a culture of knowledge-sharing and teamwork. Throughout all of this I have continued to be supported by TISE in studying for professional qualifications from an early stage, most recently completing the International Diploma in Financial Crime Prevention with Distinction.&#x201D;</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="textslider-slides-item">
                    <h2>Jennifer Baudains, Office Manager & Marketing Executive</h2>
                    <div class="cols c1">
                            <h3>&quot;I&#x2019;ve worked at TISE since 2015 and when I had my daughter in 2022 I wanted to look at adjusting my hours. TISE was incredibly supportive of this and the flexible working policy has allowed me to create a great work / life balance. This means as well as being part of a fantastic team and still feeling able to contribute to the continuing success of the business, I also get to spend quality time with my daughter and watch her grow. I&#x2019;m very grateful to work for a company that is forward thinking and supportive of its staff.&quot;</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="textslider-slides-item">
                    <h2>Cameron Craine, Head of Listings</h2>
                    <div class="cols c1">
                            <h3>&#x201C;I joined TISE in 2011 as an Assistant Analyst and have most recently been promoted to Director and Head of Listings. TISE has supported my progression and I am grateful to work for an amazing company that actively supports staff development, provides clear career progression and rewards them accordingly.&#x201D;</h3>
                    </div>
                </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div><div class="textscrolltext mb-6" id="_7c4dddb2e0cc46b399edfda05ad2908b">
    <div class="textscrolltext-pin">
        <div class="textscrolltext-pin-inner">
            <div class="content-wrap">
                <div class="rte">
                    <h2>Careers</h2>
<p>If you are interested in any of our current opportunities or just want to find out more about working at TISE then we are always interested in hearing from talented individuals who have an interest in joining the TISE team.</p>
<p><a href="mailto:laura.cornelius@tisegroup.com" title="Careers" class="btnsimple btn">Connect</a></p>
<div style="padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;"></div>
                </div>
