<div class="content-wrap  box-bg" id="_db962c91b0184ead80abc6d61f59b4dc" style="">
    <div class="rte wide">
        <h2>Our Commitment to the Community</h2>
<p><strong>Our charity of choice</strong></p>
<h3>Each year at TISE, our staff nominate and then vote for a local charity to be our Charity of Choice for us to support for the year.</h3>
<p>Throughout the year we look to organise fundraising initiatives to raise as much money as possible for our chosen charity, at the end of the year TISE then matches the amount that has been raised. <br />Our Charity of Choice for this year is Safer with past charities including the Priaulx Premature Baby Foundation, Guernsey Victim Support &amp; Witness Service, Help a Guernsey Child, Guernsey Mind, Les Bourgs Hospice and the GSPCA.</p>
    </div>
</div><div class="content-wrap mt-3 mb-3 box-bg" id="_a79d5a85c9a041dfb974051ff4b4f413" style="">
    <div class="rte narrow">
        <p><strong>Volunteering<br /></strong>Giving back to the community is not just about financial contributions, therefore, we also look to support our staff in having paid time off to volunteer for our Charity of Choice for each year.</p>
    </div>
</div>
    </div>
